# SQLite databases – the full runtime DB is too large for GitHub (market history
# is ~99% of it), so it stays local. Only the small core snapshot is tracked; the
# launcher bootstraps the runtime DB from it on a fresh clone. Regenerate the core
# with: python make_core_db.py
*.db
!eve_manufacturing_core.db
# Optional future split DB for market-only cache (keep ignored)
eve_market_prices.db
*.db-journal
fuzzwork_prices_*.csv
fuzzwork_prices_*.json

